{"pageid":2133,"title":"Update Log/Version 1.47.0","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Update Log/Version 1.47.0</span>","revid":9377,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This page contains all the changes made in <b>Version 1.47.0</b>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Official_update_log\">Official update log</span></h2>\n<p><b>Added</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>Some cake and balloons are available in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">the Oak Depot</a>! They will be available  for a limited time of 2 weeks (Jan 28 US Time). Get them while you can!</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Changes\">Changes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Added <a href=\"/wiki/Anniversary_Cake\" title=\"Anniversary Cake\">Anniversary Cake</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Anniversary_Balloons\" title=\"Anniversary Balloons\">Anniversary Balloons</a> to the limited-time shelf in the Oak Depot.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260903163716\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:2133-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260903163716 and revision id 9377. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Anniversary Balloons","exists":true},{"title":"Anniversary Cake","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"images":[]}
